veld (https://github.com/prosperity-solutions/veld, MIT License, commit
575a7452594489e2aae2c01000099b0c39a40686):

  - the ship workflow: .agents/skills/ship/SKILL.md (also docs/ship.md)
  - the review method: docs/agentic-review.md
  - the ship stamp: scripts/dev/prmeta.sh and scripts/ci/ship-gate.sh
    (ported from outfit's tests/validate-ship-stamp.sh, rewritten in POSIX sh)
  - the `commits` and `ship` jobs in .github/workflows/ci.yml
  - scripts/dev/harden-public-repo.sh (structure)
  - the structure of AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .claude/agents/, lefthook.yml,
    .github/dependabot.yml and .github/fresh-deps.txt

